    "Apple Music tokens need a paid Apple Developer Program membership ($99/yr) to create a MusicKit key. Without it, choose Spotify above or leave this empty — Cassette still uses free MusicBrainz for ISRC." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Apple Music token requirements.",
