    "Automatic prefers original quality on Wi-Fi and cellular, and lowers quality if playback cannot keep up. Lossless requires a lossless source on your server." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatic prefers original quality on Wi-Fi and cellular, and lowers quality if playback cannot keep up. Lossless requires a lossless source on your server."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "자동은 Wi-Fi와 셀룰러에서 원본 음질을 우선하며, 재생이 원활하지 않으면 음질을 낮춥니다. 무손실 재생에는 서버의 무손실 음원이 필요합니다."
          }
