    "For testing. Reset clears caches only. Show onboarding again also deletes all saved servers and passwords, then restarts language selection and sign-in." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For testing. Reset clears caches only. Show onboarding again also deletes all saved servers and passwords, then restarts language selection and sign-in."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "테스트용입니다. 초기화는 캐시만 지웁니다. 온보딩 다시 보기는 저장된 서버와 비밀번호를 모두 삭제한 뒤 언어 선택과 로그인부터 다시 시작합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For testing. Reset clears caches only. Show onboarding again also deletes all saved servers and passwords, then restarts the full welcome and sign-in flow." : {
