    "Spotify Web API Client ID and Secret (Client Credentials) for ISRC. The Spotify account that owns the Developer app must have Premium (Spotify Dev Mode). If Spotify returns 403, Cassette falls back to MusicBrainz. Album descriptions still come from Wikipedia." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Spotify Web API Client ID and Secret (Client Credentials) that is used to retrieve ISRCs.",
